        "finding": "missingConnection ignores speed-retention and actual-turn failures when geometric coverage reaches100%; missingLink lumps all failure causes into one link family.",
        "recommendation": "Diagnose incomplete condition and choose bridge timing for missing coverage, speed planning/hold for retention, coordinated steering/line for actual turn, and direct link hold only after upstream anchor is measured."
